Feature: Ixigo Train Search Module

  Background: 
    Given User is on the train search page

  @valid
  Scenario: Validate correct train list appears for valid stations
    When User enters data in From field and enters data in To field
    And User selects date
    And User clicks on Search for valid data
    Then Train list should display according to From, To and on selected date

  @errorCheck
  Scenario: Validate error when same station is entered in From and To field
    When User enters data in From and To feilds
    And User clicks on Search for invalid data
    Then User should see error message

  @seatCheck
  Scenario: User checks seat availability after searching trains
    When the user enters data in source and in destination with date
    And clicks the search button
    And clicks Show Availability for the first train
    Then seat availability details should be displayed

  @filter
  Scenario: User applies quota and class filter
    When User enters source and destination with date and clicks on search
    And User clicks on quota and class filter
      | row | quotaCol | classCol |
      |   0 |        0 |        1 |
    Then Only trains matching quota and class should be displayed

  @swap
  Scenario: Verify swapping source and destination in train search
    When User enters valid source and destination and selects travel date
    And User clicks on swap button
    Then It should swap the source and destination

  @invalidData
  Scenario Outline: Search train with invalid station input
    When User enter station details from sheet <SheetIndex> row <RowIndex>
    And User clicks search
    Then User verify the error message is displayed

    Examples: 
      | SheetIndex | RowIndex |
      |          0 |        1 |
